From e055036aed422f1f84061d76578f5230b4bf60d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:18:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] The Administrator: the wizard stays home from field dives
 (building slice 12a)

On a field party's dive (and a posting's defense) the wizard directs from
the campus and is not on the board, unless summoned, the fight is the
wizard's own sortie (a shard guardian, an archmage's resolution), or no
companion is able to fight.

- Administrator.cs: the presence rule, Summon the Wizard (5 splinters,
  2 days added to the dive), Sally Port waives the days.
- SortieState.WizardSummoned / SummonDays (charged in ChargeSortieDays,
  cleared with the slot); round-trip asserted.
- Expedition HUD: Summon the Wizard button on field dives.
- CombatManager: wizard spawn gated; persistent deck, school and
  attunement keyed on the wizard's id, not slot 0; a combat-log line says
  why the wizard is or is not there.
- Field runs no longer reset or heal the wizard's carried HP unless the
  wizard is with that party; a wizard fresh from the campus comes whole.
- Card predicates prefer the active caster over the primary unit.
- teleport_sigil.json: the Sally Port unblocked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
